{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["And this will be for you a sign, that your hearts will be strengthened and will not soften when you hear the outcry of the Egyptians at the death of their firstborn — because of the destroyer, because of the blood which I see I will pass over you, and there will be no plague among you, for this blood will be a sign upon the destroyer."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:32.842703595Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}